<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intimate Brands upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intimate Brands upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities upgraded Intimate Brands Inc to buy from hold, a Prudential source said  </p>
<p>-- Prudential later confirmed the change.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 3/8 to 17-1/4.</p>
</text>
